{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-12-06 06:58:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT WITH ENGIE FOR SUPPLY OF U.S. LNG FROM PORT ARTHUR LNG PHASE 1', 'text': 'HOUSTON , DEC. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, A SUBSIDIARY OF SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE),\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO A LONG-TERM SALE AND PURCHASE AGREEMENT (SPA) WITH ENGIE S.A. FOR THE SUPPLY OF LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS (LNG) FROM PHASE 1 OF ITS PROPOSED PORT ARTHUR LNG PROJECT UNDER DEVELOPMENT IN JEFFERSON COUNTY, TEXAS.'}